  "rule": "Before each launch (stage 1; stage 2 is not a new admission): a fresh lane scan (native solver/checker processes plus python processes whose cwd or argv lies in the lane or a review/moqls8-* desk, excluding this driver and its children; python counts as busy if its CPU use over a 2 s libproc window is >= 50%; lane RSS includes every such python) and a fresh statvfs: launch only if lane busy + 3 <= 4 (v6b: the one live native + this driver + one transient helper), lane RSS of all other lane processes + max(fresh measured driver RSS, reservation; unreadable refuses) <= 11 GiB (gb reservation = the 6 GiB pipeline cap; controls 512 MiB), free >= 12,200,000,000 + 80 MiB, no exclusion breach (no parent GA replay native or replay/launch driver: the parent GA driver must have exited; no other kissat; no other GB pipeline driver), no helper survivor; two consecutive passing checks 60 s apart; otherwise sleep 60 s and re-check, total gate wait bounded by 600 s (v6b). No native spawn at or after 2026-10-22 19:00:33 PDT, nor one whose remaining stage backstops do not fit the driver chunk (v6b). gb items additionally need the unchanged parent stability rule read from observer v3 (control/resource-observer-live-v3.jsonl; addenda v1 9aff1085... and v2 6ddac862...; old amendment 0bbf4fdf...ce87): complete JSON lines, event records (start/restart) ignored and never reconstructed, every sample tz-aware with an int free, strictly increasing timestamps, last sample 0 <= age <= 30 s with free >= 13.5e9 + 80 MiB, >= 25 samples spanning >= 290 s within the last 300 s, max peak-to-later drop <= max(300,000,000, (free_last - 13.5e9) // 12); a malformed complete line or a naive, non-monotone or stale sample refuses; the rule and a fresh statvfs are re-read at the launch decision. Immediately before EACH native spawn (kissat, drat-trim) the launch threshold free >= 12.2e9 + 80 MiB, the latched stop/exclusion/scanner state, the 19:00:33 cutoff, the 21:50 deadline and the chunk fit are checked again (stage 2 also lane busy + 3 <= 4 and the 11 GiB lane total from the newest reading). The run also needs the parent GO record (validate_go) and, for gb items, the seven qualified control receipts (receipt + commit) of this script sha256.",
